=== Outdoors ===
[[Cat Girl]] Mieke
* It's exciting for us to visit the country of X! You have such unique tuxemon here ... Hey, do you want to trade? My [[Conileaf]] for a creature that we don't have back home ... how about [[Budaye]]? Y/N

[[Beachcomber]] Fez
* Everyone in our region has to pick from one of the same five boring tuxemon. I know like a hundred people with a [[Foxfire]] ... Hey, do you want to trade? My [[Foxfire]] for an [[Ignibus]]? Y/N

[[Snugglepot]] Cady
* Oh I'd just love to have a souvenier to take back home with me. I just adore those sweet little [[Grintot]]. Could you get me one? I could give you my [[Hampotamos]] in exchange? Y/N

[[Picnicker]] Teach
* Oh where has my other student gotten to?

[[Child Actor]] Sandy
* This [[Pharfan]] keeps spraying me with water. What a drag! Hey, do you want it? You'd have to give me a [[Tweesher]] in return. Y/N

[[Fisher]]
If player has [[Fishing Rod]]:
* It's a slow pleasure, but there's nothing nicer than fishing by the water. 
* Just select your Rod from the Bag while facing the river.

If player does not:
* Get yourself a Fishing Rod so you can enjoy the water as I do.

