* ''(First time spoken to)'' I found these eggs in the bough of a tree, and hatched them! They appear to be a previously unknown tuxemon. I call them [[Vivipere]]! I wonder what they morph into. 
* ''(Then, and in the future if refused the first time)'' Tell you what, why don't I give you one and you can come back and tell me what it morphs into! Y/N

''(If the player returns having morphed it)''
